# Copy to .env and edit. All settings are optional; each falls back to a
# directory inside the repository. See ARTIFACTS.md for the archive layout.

# Where the zip archives live. Point this at your copy of the artifact archive
# (an iCloud/Drive folder, an external disk, a share) and run
# scripts/fetch_artifacts.sh to unpack what the code needs.
#TOSKIPORNOT_ARCHIVE=/Users/you/Documents/2024-11-CIBM/artifacts

# Where the unpacked images, masks and perturbed test sets live.
# Default: <repo>/data
#TOSKIPORNOT_DATA=/mnt/big-disk/toskipornot/data

# Where the trained model weights live.
# Default: <repo>/checkpoints
#TOSKIPORNOT_CHECKPOINTS=/mnt/big-disk/toskipornot/checkpoints

# Where metrics CSVs, figures and videos are written.
# Default: <repo>/results
#TOSKIPORNOT_RESULTS=/mnt/big-disk/toskipornot/results
